<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thank You for showing me Your heart’s desire:</l><l>You would be one with me—I say, Amen!</l><l>You’re fully able to accomplish this;</l><l>Today, I give myself to You.</l><l>To not live contradiction, I agree—</l><l>With any kind of friction in my being.</l><l>In all the ordinary things of life,</l><l>Lord, make me always one with You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
